=== SUMMARY ===
data sources : none (web parity: the controlled ActionBuilder binds no hook beyond useTranslation; actions/channels are props, edits flow through onChange). The page seeds the editor via ActionBuilderPageModel.actionBuilderSampleActions()/actionBuilderSampleChannels() — one Command (valid JSON params), Notify, SetSetting and CallAutomation — so every field set renders.
nav          : web source is unrouted; Destinations.kt unchanged and no PageHosts row (no destination id). The page is a complete hostable surface consumed by embedding, mirroring the web editor's <ActionBuilder/> usage. RouteTableTest stays green (ActionBuilder is intentionally not in the web route table).
panels       : the 1 manifest panel (GlassPanel1) is the per-action GlassPanel card from the embedded feature view (ActionCard); the page adds only a scrolling token-padded Column scaffold, no separate panel, so no region is ever blank (ADR-011).
states       : the 2 declared data states (error / success) are the command-params JSON validation matrix in CommandFields — invalid/not-an-object ⇒ error text, valid object ⇒ commit + cleared error. Reachable from the seeded Command action.
strings      : 27/27 via the i18n facade with verbatim web keys (ActionBuilderText). 26 resolve from res/values/strings.xml (translation_*); the 1 key web itself leaves to its inline default (commandParamsObjectError, absent from web/src/i18n) resolves via the identical t(key,'Params must be a JSON object.') fallback — same rendered text as web, no catalog drift. Zero hardcoded UI literals.
a11y/theme   : layout on MaterialTheme/design tokens (Spacing) — no hardcoded color/typography (ADR-005); the feature view gives the icon-only move/remove controls explicit contentDescriptions and the Selects/Inputs/Textareas visible labels (TalkBack); Material enforces 48dp targets; dark + dynamic color via TeslaSyncTheme (ADR-015). No units are stored/computed (ADR-013).
diagnostics  : page records the one-shot PII-safe view.opened (surface="ActionBuilderPage", P1/S11) distinct from the embedded feature view's own (surface="ActionBuilder"); only slugs are logged.
